/**
 * Orchestrator command handlers, merged into a single module.
 *
 * Handlers call each other (a message dispatch can create a thread; a thread
 * mutation can cancel a queued run), so they ship as one unit with an explicit
 * dependency object rather than as mutually-importing modules.
 */
